## Files

| Path | What |
|---|---|
| `.tlk/goals/<date>-<slug>/goal.md` | The goal and its definition of done |
| `.tlk/goals/<date>-<slug>/handoff-log.md` | Every iteration, in pipeline entry format |
| `.tlk/goals/<date>-<slug>/summary.md` | Written once, on stop |
| `.tlk/goals/<date>-<slug>/metrics.jsonl` | Measured tokens/cost per iteration (`record-metrics.sh`) |

All of `.tlk/` is git-ignored by the kit's managed block — a goal loop commits nothing of its own.
